ttered like a broken mirror. \nWhere does the truth lie?\n\nTo kill, or not to kill \u2500 YOU decide.\n\n-Production Staff\nDirector\uff1aHaruki Kashiwakura (Motion Director of Expelled from Paradise)\nScriptwriter\uff1aKou Segawa (Mystery Writer, Konya, Kimi ni Korosareta to shitemo)\nProducer\uff1aKazuma Miki (Editor/Producer of Sword Art Online)\nCharacter Design\uff1aLAM (Illustrator)", "short_description": "\u201cTOKYO CHRONOS\u201d is coming on March 20th, and we are getting ready to distribute the trial version! \n\n\u201cThe next Visual Novel awaits beyond the screen.\u201d\nVR Mystery Visual Novel, A story told in an immersive 360-degree world. The story changes as you make decisions.\n\n-An empty, deserted Shibuya where time has frozen over. A mystery full of suspense, woven by 8 childhood friends trapped inside.\n\nA lost memory. A mysterious message, \"I am dead. Who killed me?\"\n\nTo kill, or not to kill \u2500 YOU decide."}]}, "developer_name": "MyDearest Inc.", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sekai Project", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tokyochronos.com/en/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["NARRATIVE", "ADVENTURE", "MUSIC"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "493650642323490"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1348043191987654"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1348043191987654"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"s